ROLE: theory_skeptic  VOTE: green
MUNDANE_EXPLANATIONS: [EXP-0037's "favorable p*" is just the textbook Leviathan/spec-decode break-even (p·S > (1-p)·W) re-skinned for a streaming prefix — no new theory; it predicts a win iff rho≥1 AND f_fl is high; gate shows neither holds, so the "surprise" was an artifact of plugging adversarial inputs (rho≥2, end-front-loaded long results) into the right algebra. Sub-100ms residual latency on 46–225-tok results is exactly what an Amdahl/serial-fraction calculation on H100 prefill rates (5–15k tok/s) predicts without any new mechanism.]
CONFOUNDS: [search_rag's single high-rho reading was confounded by an artificially short N_step=11 (answer-emit, not a reasoning step); once N_step is set to a realistic 64–256 the rho>=1 fraction collapses to 0% — the "high-rho class" was a measurement artifact, not a real operating point. HotpotQA distractor corpus is itself a synthetic stress set, not representative of agent web_search traffic.]
ASSUMPTIONS_UNTESTED: [Incremental-prefill claim ("sub-100ms residual on H100") is asserted from prefill-rate arithmetic, not measured end-to-end on a real vLLM/SGLang stack; however, since the gate KILLS the claim, this asymmetry only makes the kill more conservative — no upside is being denied. Tokenizer choice (gpt2 BPE) vs production tokenizers (Llama/Qwen SP) — minor token-count drift, does not move rho by an order of magnitude.]
STATISTICAL_GAPS: [No bootstrap CIs on the rho-band %-clearing-rho>=1 numbers, but the effect is ≥1 OOM (median rho 0.007–0.508 vs gate of 1.0) so CIs would not flip the verdict; Spearman corr on db_query (n=41) is underpowered but is the smallest class and not load-bearing; the dominant-pool weighting is reasonable (excludes the synthetic search_rag) and the kill is robust to including it.]
RATIONALE: The gate is the textbook test of the theory's load-bearing premises (rho>=1, f_fl high, joint independence) on real data, and both premises fail by ≥1 OOM on 4/5 real classes; the 5th class fails the joint-independence assumption (the committee#1 worry — adversarial anti-correlation of rho and f_fl) AND collapses to rho<<1 under a realistic next-step. The mechanism is real but its lucrative regime is empirically empty — exactly the kind of clean negative the theory-skeptic role exists to reward. Prior-art mapping is honest: LLMCompiler (arXiv:2312.04511) captures the inter-call latency losslessly at the call-graph level, CALM (arXiv:2207.07061) does confidence-gated early-exit on own decode not tool results, Leviathan-2023 spec-decode supplies the algebraic ancestor losslessly — the open niche (correctness-safe semantic commit on partial tool RESULT) is genuine but the gate proves it empirically empty. KILL is the correct, theory-grounded call; pre-registration (HEAD 9e9a788) and the cheap-gate-before-GPU discipline are working as intended.
